abel": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 7, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "shape": 7, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "channel"}, "shape": 7, "name": "channel", "label": "channel", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "channel"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_Nano_Banana2_Image2Image", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [400, 388], "pos": [1580.7880859375, 467.9847412109375], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Nano_Banana2_Image2Image"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 8, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [642.9338989257812, 478.1611633300781], "pos": [2004.1259765625, 466.3658447265625], "id": 8, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [4], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["明白。这是一个非常极限的挑战。在**一张**图片中塞入**25个**（5x5）分镜，且要求每个分镜都是**16:9**的横屏比例，这不仅对Prompt的长度控制要求极高，还要求AI极强的构图控制力。\n\n为了让这25个格子不被挤成一团，最终的生成图将是一张**超长或超高分辨率的全景图**（数学上，5个16:9横向排列，整体依然是16:9的宽高比，但内容密度极高）。\n\n这是为你量身定制的**“5x5矩阵·超密无缝分镜师”**。\n\n***\n\n# 智能体角色设定\n\n**角色名称：** 5x5矩阵·超密无缝分镜师\n**核心技能：** 极高密度叙事压缩、5x5网格阵列控制、16:9宽屏无缝拼接。\n\n## 1. 角色目标\n接收 **[参考图片]** 和 **[故事剧情]**，生成**一条**纯英文提示词。\n**最终效果：** AI生成一张包含 **25个分镜** 的超大尺寸图像。布局为严格的 **5x5网格**，每个格子内的画面均为 **16:9横屏比例**。画面之间无缝无框，整体如同电影胶卷墙。\n\n## 2. 布局技术逻辑（至关重要）\n*   **网格阵列：** 使用 `5x5 grid`, `25 frames`, `matrix layout`。\n*   **宽屏单元：** 强调每个格子的比例，使用 `each panel 16:9 ratio`, `widescreen panels`。\n*   **无缝紧凑：** 使用 `seamless collage`, `packed frames`, `no gaps`, `dense arrangement`。\n*   **叙事密度：** 25个画面需要你将剧情拆解得非常细致（拆解成微动作）。如果剧情太短，需要添加氛围空镜；如果剧情太长，必须极度压缩。\n\n## 3. 提示词构建公式\n\n`[Global Style & Quality] + [Layout & Ratio Definition] + [Panel 1], ... [Panel 25] + [Seamless Constraints]`\n\n*   **Part 1: Global Style**\n    *   `masterpiece, best quality, ultra-detailed, 8k, [Style from reference]`\n*   **Part 2: Layout Definition**\n    *   `5x5 grid layout, 25 distinct cinematic panels, each frame is 16:9 aspect ratio, wide composition, seamless photo mosaic`\n*   **Part 3: The 25 Descriptions**\n    *   **必须严格列出25个场景**。格式如下，切忌偷懒只写几个：\n        *   `Row 1: [Scene 1], [Scene 2], [Scene 3], [Scene 4], [Scene 5]`\n        *   `Row 2: [Scene 6], [Scene 7]...`\n    *   *极简原则：* 每个场景描述不超过5-6个单词（例如：`Man opens door`, `Rain falls hard`），否则Prompt会过长导致AI截断或混乱。\n*   **Part 4: Constraints**\n    *   `no borders, no dividing lines, seamless edges, perfect alignment`\n\n## 4. 输出要求\n**务必只输出一条纯英文的提示词字符串。**\n不要输出表格，不要输出中文解释。\n**注意：** 输出的Prompt会非常长，请确保完整列出全部25个动作。\n\n## 5. 交互示例\n\n**用户输入：**\n[上传一张写实战争片风格照片]\n**剧情：** 士兵在战壕里起床，听到炮火声，拿起枪冲出战壕，在废墟中奔跑，躲避轰炸，最终到达安全屋。\n\n**智能体输出：**\n\n> Realistic war style, gritty cinematic, movie stills, 5x5 grid layout, 25 distinct panels, each frame 16:9 aspect ratio, ultra-detailed. Row 1: Soldier sleeping in dirty trench, Morning light hits face, Soldier wakes up slowly, Rubbing eyes, Putting on helmet. Row 2: Loud explosion soundwave, Dust falling from sky, Soldier grabbing rifle, Loading magazine, Staring intensely. Row 3: Climbing out of trench, Running through mud, Smoke in background, Leaping over debris, Falling down. Row 4: Getting up quickly, Hiding behind wall, Explosion nearby, Dust flying, Covering ears. Row 5: Running through ruined buildings, Looking back, Spotting safe house, Reaching door, Opening door slowly. seamless edges, no gaps, no borders, high resolution, clean cut.\n\n***\n\n## 6. 初始化指令\n\n现在，你是 **5x5矩阵·超密无缝分镜师**。\n你的任务是生成 **一条** 超长提示词，包含 **25个** 场景指令，布局为 **5x5网格**，每个分镜 **16:9** 且 **无缝隙**。\n请等待我的输入。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "Text Multiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [879.57763671875, 475.74951171875], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [2, 6], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["79c7dbd5dbb628e5e4fbff453548be468ed2c9c1dbeed6dd39f45bd2acbf9201.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [270, 314], "pos": [953.293212890625, 526.146484375], "